It's just neat way to forget to fireproof his butt


00:01:30.898 --> 00:01:33.871
Hot! Hot hot hot!
Guys, no! Not yet!


00:01:35.641 --> 00:01:37.839
Behold, your worst nightmare!
Behold!


00:01:37.845 --> 00:01:40.841
