00:01:46.864 --> 00:01:49.837
Sorry! I'm still getting hang of my wings


00:01:49.837 --> 00:01:51.775
Fishleg, Again with a baby?


00:01:52.777 --> 00:01:54.906
This is a raid
I couldn't find a sitter.


00:01:55.749 --> 00:01:57.914
Demons everywhere! This is the end of the world!


00:02:00.726 --> 00:02:03.665
Astrid, I had him right where I wanted him


00:02:03.699 --> 00:02:06.867
And now he is right where I wanted him!


00:02:06.873 --> 00:02:08.810
- Let's get to work
- Okay, we screwed that up


00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:10.838
