00:02:22.937 --> 00:02:25.876
The Crimson Coregutter


00:02:30.721 --> 00:02:34.719
Look at this wierdo! That's super dumb!


00:02:35.932 --> 00:02:38.700
Why can't I get this cage open


00:02:38.704 --> 00:02:39.866
Its Slides,


00:02:39.906 --> 00:02:42.743
- Obviously!
- Attack!


00:02:42.779 --> 00:02:44.751
Get the rescues out of here


00:02:49.993 --> 00:02:51.931
No running on the deck, its slippery!
You can fall


00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:53.894
Step Aside!


00:02:53.902 --> 00:02:55.931
Let me handle the tough guy stuff


00:02:59.881 --> 00:03:01.944
That's 2 for me


00:03:05.895 --> 00:03:06.885
Look out!


00:03:07.731 --> 00:03:08.792
Sorry


00:03:17.752 --> 00:03:18.982
Thank you


00:03:19.021 --> 00:03:20.993
Now! Go to the other rest of our


00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:25.732
I thought this was suppose to be a stealth mission


00:03:25.769 --> 00:03:27.763
Yeah, they always start that way!


00:03:30.846 --> 00:03:32.009
Thank you, Stormfly!


00:03:34.889 --> 00:03:36.985
Stop worrying they'll get it.


00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:42.999
Eventually


00:03:43.908 --> 00:03:45.900
Move out! We got them all


00:03:45.943 --> 00:03:49.817
I am gonna handlock every last one of you.
I might even headlock you


00:03:50.822 --> 00:03:53.852
Amateurs, It just getting started


00:03:53.861 --> 00:03:55.763
Clear up Guys! Go! Go!


00:04:01.878 --> 00:04:03.848
Good hustle boys!


00:04:05.786 --> 00:04:07.951
Toothless, time to go!


00:04:15.907 --> 00:04:17.774
Hey Guys!


00:04:22.821 --> 00:04:24.985
You always have my back right!?


00:04:41.093 --> 00:04:43.861
This is Berk


00:04:43.865 --> 00:04:45.859
Your new home away from home


00:04:45.902 --> 00:04:49.844
A stunning one stop all expense paid
dream destination


00:04:51.014 --> 00:04:54.010
So settle in and let your worries melt away


00:04:54.889 --> 00:04:59.024
The service here is sourced,
The cuisine is fiery


00:05:00.099 --> 00:05:03.074
And the locals are as colourful as you get


00:05:03.908 --> 00:05:07.940
Any run of the mill paradise boasts
beaches and sunshine


00:05:09.018 --> 00:05:10.112
But not us


00:05:10.154 --> 00:05:13.024
We have something that no one else can touch


00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:17.029
We my friend, have dragons!


00:05:17.135 --> 00:05:21.099
Lots and lots of dragons!


00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:33.035
And meet our latest Berkins


00:05:35.875 --> 00:05:37.868
Welcome to paradise, meat!?


00:05:37.911 --> 00:05:39.141
You're a beauty


00:05:39.147 --> 00:05:41.881
You're welcome


00:05:41.886 --> 00:05:44.951
I took on like a 100 trappers...
a 1000 trappers


00:05:44.993 --> 00:05:49.936
With his own burning undies
My thick full beard almost caught on fire


00:05:49.936 --> 00:05:51.999
Just. Just Stop!


00:05:52.041 --> 00:05:57.111
So, Hiccup's mom, do you know it's my bone crashing assault
or is it pretty much perfect


00:05:57.119 --> 00:05:59.956
It was indescribable


00:05:59.992 --> 00:06:03.090
And please call me Valka. It has been a year


00:06:03.098 --> 00:06:04.898
First name basis!


00:06:04.935 --> 00:06:07.099
I think the real hero of the day was Toothless


00:06:07.139 --> 00:06:09.042
Is that right bud


00:06:09.076 --> 00:06:13.075
What would we do without you, King of Dragons
What would we do?!


00:06:13.085 --> 00:06:17.960
Well! We could train a lot harder for one
That was pretty sloppy


00:06:18.062 --> 00:06:20.193
Astrid does have a point


00:06:20.234 --> 00:06:24.074
The actual, we rely a little bit to much on your dragons


00:06:24.076 --> 00:06:27.015
and not enough for one another


00:06:27.015 --> 00:06:29.179
See, that's what exactly what I was saying
just listen up guys


00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:32.159
Yeap! Your mom is super impressed with me


00:06:32.159 --> 00:06:34.129
I'm like the son she always wanted


00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:37.002
Fishmeal!


00:06:37.002 --> 00:06:38.132
You found a new friend


00:06:42.045 --> 00:06:43.139
Watch your heads!


00:07:02.087 --> 00:07:03.056
What good


00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:06.996
is having the King of Dragons around,
if he can't keep the order


00:07:07.031 --> 00:07:09.971
Hey bud! You want to do something here or


00:07:16.017 --> 00:07:19.149
and where do you suppose we put these ones


00:07:19.157 --> 00:07:20.957
We'll make room


00:07:22.029 --> 00:07:25.003
You brought back a Hobgobbler


00:07:25.036 --> 00:07:28.009
They're bad omen. We're cursed!


00:07:29.043 --> 00:07:30.137
Nonsense


00:07:30.179 --> 00:07:32.117
What harm can he do?!


00:07:32.117 --> 00:07:35.182
No injuries, in all a little shaken
but in otherwise healthy


00:07:35.191 --> 00:07:38.129
Now, who's hungry


00:07:43.108 --> 00:07:46.172
The point is you can't keep
bringing dragons back here


00:07:47.215 --> 00:07:50.121
- Come on boy
- You just asking for trouble


00:07:51.291 --> 00:07:54.162
Who's trouble is getting closer by the day


00:07:54.197 --> 00:07:56.169
We can handle them. We have the Alpha.


00:07:56.202 --> 00:07:58.103
Ain't that right bud


00:07:58.138 --> 00:08:00.076
Would you look how happy they are!


00:08:00.276 --> 00:08:03.044
She's Awesome!


00:08:03.249 --> 00:08:06.051
Gobber, relax. We did it!


00:08:06.088 --> 00:08:08.253
The world 1st dragon-viking utopia


00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:10.093
We made the dream a reality


00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:14.760
Your dream, maybe
mine is less crowded and more


00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:17.136
Sanitary!


00:08:17.178 --> 00:08:20.152
Gobber, You're not fooling anybody
I know you love them


00:08:24.128 --> 00:08:29.092
You supposed to be the generation
that leads us to the future


00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:31.300
Food Fight!


00:08:32.275 --> 00:08:34.270
Gorgeous!


00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.114
Watch the hair!


00:08:36.114 --> 00:08:38.110
Good fish meat! Am nom nom nom!


00:08:39.258 --> 00:08:41.229
God help us


00:08:41.229 --> 00:08:44.201
Try to stop worrying about the problems out there,


00:08:44.201 --> 00:08:47.107
and start sorting out the ones right here!


00:08:47.142 --> 00:08:48.304
Ok ok! I think we got it


00:08:48.344 --> 00:08:51.340
Hang up your saddles and get married


00:08:53.119 --> 00:08:56.116
- The M word
- Gross, unless its me


00:08:56.326 --> 00:09:00.233
Start ruling like a proper royal couple


00:09:00.268 --> 00:09:04.233
Marry him please,
you're the only one with any sense around here


00:09:04.243 --> 00:09:07.239
- With you waiting the pads, there still hope
- Woah!


00:09:07.283 --> 00:09:09.278
- Gobber
- Not awkward at all!


00:09:11.192 --> 00:09:13.185
Astrid, don't be like that


00:09:13.195 --> 00:09:15.224
Whew! That is a definitive no!


00:09:15.233 --> 00:09:18.173
Look! If you need a beard to cry on?!


00:09:18.207 --> 00:09:22.169
Just lean on my shoulder and you
can cry on my full thick beard


00:09:22.214 --> 00:09:26.384
Thank you, Tuffnut. Thank you... so much


00:09:27.258 --> 00:09:32.099
Eret, son of Eret What is the report


00:09:32.134 --> 00:09:34.231
Two more trapper budges spotted in the straight


00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.368
So we go after them


00:09:35.442 --> 00:09:37.208
What!?


00:09:37.212 --> 00:09:39.240
One day you gonna pick a fight


00:09:39.283 --> 00:09:41.221
you can't win


00:10:10.317 --> 00:10:12.183
Archers!


00:10:20.469 --> 00:10:23.374
Deathgrippers


00:10:44.419 --> 00:10:49.295
The dragon raiders attacked us here,
of the Eastern Straight


00:10:49.295 --> 00:10:51.290
Ragnar Rock!


00:10:52.236 --> 00:10:53.261
Sorry


00:10:53.271 --> 00:10:59.217
My dear Warlords, how go your plans
to conquer the world


00:11:00.522 --> 00:11:05.395
Grimmel, my old friend. Thank you for coming!


00:11:07.368 --> 00:11:09.499
A year since Drago's defeat


00:11:09.506 --> 00:11:13.445
and no following along your dragon army I see


00:11:13.479 --> 00:11:16.385
You can thank the young chief of Berk for that


00:11:16.386 --> 00:11:18.357
Storik's boy


00:11:19.325 --> 00:11:23.290
He and his peace loving dragon riders
continue to raid our ships


00:11:23.334 --> 00:11:25.498
and steal our dragons


00:11:25.505 --> 00:11:28.273
That does sound like a nuisance


00:11:28.312 --> 00:11:31.479
But i'm in a business of killing dragons,
not retrieving them


00:11:32.286 --> 00:11:33.346
But, Grimmel


00:11:33.388 --> 00:11:36.293
That idiot boy who has done all for you


00:11:36.294 --> 00:11:38.265
Gathering the dragons in one place


00:11:38.298 --> 00:11:39.427
Why bothers me


00:11:39.435 --> 00:11:44.400
Because the flock is protected by a Night Fury


00:11:47.383 --> 00:11:49.252
That's not possible


00:11:49.455 --> 00:11:52.519
It seems one slipped through your fingers


00:11:52.528 --> 00:11:56.495
Look Berk's dragons will follow the Alpha


00:11:56.505 --> 00:11:59.375
So we will pay you to capture him


00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:01.539
and bring the flock to us


00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:06.388
We even have your favourite paid


00:12:06.559 --> 00:12:11.399
The only dragon they left us
from the last night's raid


00:12:11.401 --> 00:12:13.464
A female?!


00:12:15.543 --> 00:12:19.575
So, do we have a deal? Old friend


00:12:33.481 --> 00:12:37.546
When all the seven done, this young chief


00:12:37.555 --> 00:12:39.550
will bring me Night Fury


00:12:39.593 --> 00:12:42.498
They don't have a leader,


00:12:42.499 --> 00:12:45.404
just a boy


00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.438
Hiccup


00:12:51.585 --> 00:12:54.491
This is Berk, son


00:12:55.427 --> 00:12:57.397
it's our home


00:12:58.030 --> 00:13:02.534
It was a home of your grandparents'
house and your grandparents before them


00:13:02.542 --> 00:13:06.448
It is my job as Chief to protect us, Hiccup


00:13:06.482 --> 00:13:09.456
And one day, when you all grown up


00:13:09.489 --> 00:13:12.656
- That job will be passed on to you
- Ok


00:13:12.662 --> 00:13:15.635
And it's very important, son, because out there,


00:13:15.669 --> 00:13:18.437
beyond the sunset,


00:13:18.442 --> 00:13:22.508
- Lies the home of the dragons
- Wow!


00:13:24.387 --> 00:13:27.418
Legend tells of ships that sailed too close to it


00:13:27.461 --> 00:13:32.427
only to drop off the edge of the world,
never to be seen again


00:13:32.471 --> 00:13:37.642
But those sailors who turned back
told tales of a great waterfall


00:13:37.647 --> 00:13:41.521
and dragons guarding the entrance
into the hidden world


00:13:42.494 --> 00:13:44.553
Not just a nest, Hiccup


00:13:44.561 --> 00:13:47.694
but a line from which all the dragons come


00:13:47.703 --> 00:13:50.608
Even Night Furies


00:13:50.609 --> 00:13:53.515
Especially Night Furies.


00:13:53.516 --> 00:13:55.010
Those are scary


00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:56.588
Don't you worry!


00:13:56.588 --> 00:13:59.561
One day I'll find the Hidden World,


00:13:59.594 --> 00:14:00.618
and seal the top


00:14:00.662 --> 00:14:06.438
so that people and dragons
will fight no more


00:14:16.462 --> 00:14:17.624
What?


00:14:19.536 --> 00:14:22.668
Oh, all right, you do know
its not a chew toy don't you?


00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:25.477
Is this what you want!
Do you want this leg! Do you want my leg


00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:28.516
Go get it!


00:14:39.577 --> 00:14:41.742
Getting pretty good at gliding on your own bud


00:14:55.777 --> 00:14:59.549
So this is where you come to get away from Gobber


00:14:59.552 --> 00:15:01.614
I have no idea what you're talking about


00:15:06.568 --> 00:15:09.597
- Well, he is right you know
- Really?!


00:15:09.608 --> 00:15:12.739
- You think you and I should
- Oh Gods no


00:15:12.780 --> 00:15:17.522
- We're no where near ready for that
- No, That's crazy


00:15:17.559 --> 00:15:19.687
I mean, he's right about all of this


00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:23.765
It does seem like the whole world knows about us now


00:15:23.769 --> 00:15:26.220
Yep, and the more dragons we bring back here,


00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:28.500
the bigger of a target we become


00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:31.670
I just wish there is some way


00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:33.260
that will make them leave us alone


00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:37.710
there might be


00:15:37.766 --> 00:15:41.571
Dad used to talk about old mariners myth


00:15:41.574 --> 00:15:43.636
of a secret land at the edge of the world


00:15:43.678 --> 00:15:46.584
where dragons lived totally out of reach


00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:50.755
- Well, sailors are know for tall tales
- True


00:15:50.795 --> 00:15:52.450
But what if its real


00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:55.700
It could be the answer to all of our problems


00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:56.760
How?


00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:59.735
By Moving the dragons there?


00:15:59.735 --> 00:16:01.840
Uh uh! All of us


00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:03.720
Seriously?!


00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:06.819
And abandon our home with 7 generations


00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:10.665
- The home your father left you to protect
- (Sigh) Uh


00:16:11.737 --> 00:16:14.768
Yeah, I think we need a real solution, Hiccup


00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:23.785
Or we can just take Gobber's advice and tie the knot


00:16:23.794 --> 00:16:25.663
That should fix everything


00:16:25.666 --> 00:16:28.270
But hey, if you're having doubts about yours truly


00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:30.800
I'm pretty sure Snotlout is available


00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:33.170
He only has eyes for your mom


00:16:35.689 --> 00:16:38.200
- Playing dirty now, huh
- You asked for it


00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:40.730
Looks like there might be a wedding after all


00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:41.700
Woah!


00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:44.799
How dare you, that was a low blow. No no


00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:46.709
You're not getting away


00:16:47.711 --> 00:16:49.615
Okay okay, you win! You win!


00:16:49.616 --> 00:16:51.587
You always win


00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:54.717
- You know what we are getting into
Aha! Right


00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:03.550
Uh! Bud!


00:17:06.886 --> 00:17:09.791
Wait! Yeah, sure, don't bother to wait for us (Sigh)


00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.400
OMGs!


00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:06.738
Hiccup!


00:19:11.847 --> 00:19:14.945
Yeah, we are friends. You do not need to kill us


00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:36.990
- Woah!
- Another Night Fury


00:19:36.999 --> 00:19:41.999
No not quite its more like a ... Bright Light Fury
- A Light Fury


00:19:42.911 --> 00:19:45.784
Yeah, yours is better, probably


00:19:47.889 --> 00:19:50.886
- What do you mean gone
- Vanished into thin air


00:19:50.929 --> 00:19:52.831
What do you think?
- Uh uh


00:19:52.932 --> 00:19:55.963
- Stubbier ears, no dorsal plates
- Uh huh, okay, got it!


00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:57.530
Huh huh! What a night


00:19:57.550 --> 00:20:00.041
What! What's getting into you


00:20:00.048 --> 00:20:02.480
What is all this slobbering and panting


00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:05.917
Isn't it obvious, he is in love


00:20:06.093 --> 00:20:09.897
Trust me, relationships are nothing but pain and misery


00:20:11.103 --> 00:20:13.007
What did I just say!


00:20:13.008 --> 00:20:15.912
Am I not enough?


00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:19.046
I think thats a "no"


00:20:30.012 --> 00:20:32.105
Something like this?


00:20:32.146 --> 00:20:34.118
You know what!
Just trace a toothless card and make her white


00:20:34.118 --> 00:20:36.921
- You could have let with that
- Can you believe it!


00:20:36.925 --> 00:20:42.028
- Toothless has a girlfriend!
- I never took you for a romantic, like ever.


00:20:42.035 --> 00:20:46.000
But it's so sweet, I mean, Look!


00:20:53.994 --> 00:20:56.056
Okay, that's just sad


00:20:56.065 --> 00:20:58.970
- And weird.
- Yeah, you better do something


00:20:58.971 --> 00:21:02.020
Seriously, I'd rather shovel poop all day than watch that


00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:05.810
Alright, let's head back to the woods and see if we can find her


00:21:08.992 --> 00:21:11.988
- Ah! Got an idea, a little private fee
- Ah


00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:16.131
Its boy talk, come on, let's go work this out
- Uh! What?


00:21:16.174 --> 00:21:20.081
- So, you want to get married?
- Uh! No, actually...


00:21:20.115 --> 00:21:22.109
Good news, I've been to 2 weddings


00:21:22.119 --> 00:21:25.994
I've crashed both but
none as hight profile as this one


00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:29.091
Lots of pressure, judgment and not just by me


00:21:29.133 --> 00:21:31.128
Look! We talked about it. We're not getting married.


00:21:31.138 --> 00:21:33.940
Hold feet, I've seen it before


00:21:33.977 --> 00:21:37.008
Don't worry little Hickie, i'm here


00:21:37.008 --> 00:21:37.952
Wait! Hickie


00:21:37.952 --> 00:21:40.500
Now, i've seen the way that
Astrid looks at you


00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:42.087
Everyone has that doubt


00:21:42.128 --> 00:21:47.037
That not so settle disappointment,
that longing for something more than you


00:21:47.037 --> 00:21:48.133
You need to focus on being worthy


00:21:48.175 --> 00:21:51.113
I mean, she's a warrior... queen for Thor's sake


00:21:51.113 --> 00:21:53.141
and you are neither


00:21:53.184 --> 00:21:56.989
But with me, as your best man.
Your spirit guide if you will


00:21:57.025 --> 00:21:59.965
You will learn to embrace your inner viking


00:21:59.965 --> 00:22:05.069
Show the nay sayers, are which there are many
that you are more than just a mo-nourish runt


00:22:05.111 --> 00:22:07.136
with bad hair, strange teeth,


00:22:07.145 --> 00:22:08.946
and a twig for a neck


00:22:08.983 --> 00:22:10.979
You're... you're really bad at pep talks


00:22:10.989 --> 00:22:13.580
Stop letting this insecurity get the best of you


00:22:13.590 --> 00:22:17.033
Everyone's watching.
I mean everyone. You need to man up!


00:22:17.067 --> 00:22:19.130
Do as I do, it will be hard


00:22:19.139 --> 00:22:21.978
but you have my word


00:22:22.013 --> 00:22:24.983
And I die brake that word, I won't give up


00:22:24.983 --> 00:22:28.024
Hey!


00:22:28.024 --> 00:22:29.300
My time here


00:22:29.310 --> 00:22:31.257
you see some shiny things in the woods and


00:22:31.263 --> 00:22:33.133
What is that?


00:22:43.054 --> 00:22:44.184
Toothless!


00:22:45.126 --> 00:22:47.097
Don't move a muscle


00:22:47.129 --> 00:22:58.101
Hey!


00:22:58.120 --> 00:23:02.027
Someone's here, he managed to slip passed our scouts


00:23:02.028 --> 00:23:03.087
And lay a trap in the woods


00:23:03.129 --> 00:23:05.067
It ruined boy talk


00:23:05.167 --> 00:23:08.073
- Let me got em
- Slow down Gobber


00:23:08.107 --> 00:23:11.046
Let's get a search team on the ground
scouts in the air


00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:12.312
Toothless and I will fly the coastline


00:23:12.318 --> 00:23:16.258
Yeah! I wouldn't advice taking Toothless anywhere chief


00:23:16.291 --> 00:23:20.255
I know this handy work
Grimmel The Grizzly


00:23:20.266 --> 00:23:22.133
Famous back where I'm from


00:23:22.170 --> 00:23:24.334
The smartest dragon hunter I've ever met


00:23:24.341 --> 00:23:27.075
Well, next to me, of course


00:23:27.113 --> 00:23:29.313
He can not be that smart. He left his trap on land


00:23:29.319 --> 00:23:34.058
Haha! Nothing is accidental when it comes to old Grimmel


00:23:34.096 --> 00:23:37.331
He lives for the hunt
to get inside the mind of his prey


00:23:37.335 --> 00:23:39.272
to control each every choice


00:23:40.176 --> 00:23:42.145
Its all a game to him


00:23:42.145 --> 00:23:44.139
Well, he doesn't know who he's playing with


00:23:44.182 --> 00:23:46.155
Yes, and we've dealt with this kind of guy before


00:23:46.155 --> 00:23:48.147
Don't underestimate him, Hiccup


00:23:48.191 --> 00:23:51.096
Mark my words, he will be back


00:23:51.097 --> 00:23:52.258
Then we'll be waiting for him


00:24:08.234 --> 00:24:11.366
Come on, Give me a clue here
Gimme a clue Dad


00:24:33.352 --> 00:24:38.124
Oh! I hope you do not mind if I help myself


00:24:38.162 --> 00:24:40.396
This is quite good


00:24:42.138 --> 00:24:45.305
That is impressive, but let me finish my drink


00:24:49.251 --> 00:24:50.312
Toothless!


00:24:53.427 --> 00:24:55.398
What did you do to him?


00:24:57.202 --> 00:24:59.230
Nothing that he won't slip off


00:25:01.000 --> 00:25:02.640
Ah! Haha! May i


00:25:03.400 --> 00:25:05.244
Chief Hiccup, huh!


00:25:05.286 --> 00:25:08.419
Do I say Chief Hiccup, or do I call you Hiccup


00:25:08.426 --> 00:25:10.259
What do you prefer?


00:25:11.430 --> 00:25:16.171
You have no idea who I am, do you?
Huh


00:25:18.000 --> 00:25:20.411
Well, Your father know of me


00:25:20.451 --> 00:25:23.390
Now, there was a Chief


00:25:23.390 --> 00:25:27.388
One of the greatest dragon hunters to have ever lived


00:25:27.432 --> 00:25:31.169
What would he think of you?


00:25:34.313 --> 00:25:35.407
He had it right you know


00:25:35.415 --> 00:25:38.252
Making it his mission to destroy the beasts


00:25:38.255 --> 00:25:40.283
so that you can grow into a better world


00:25:40.292 --> 00:25:42.263
He changed his mind


00:25:42.263 --> 00:25:44.393
Look where that got him


00:25:44.433 --> 00:25:47.430
So let's get to the point


00:25:48.430 --> 00:25:51.000
I'm the Night Fury killer


00:25:51.310 --> 00:25:55.382
I hunted every last one but yours


00:25:56.000 --> 00:25:58.000
You are going to give me that dragon


00:25:58.000 --> 00:26:01.303
- Or I will...
- I will never give him up


00:26:03.308 --> 00:26:06.439
You wish dragons to live free among us


00:26:06.446 --> 00:26:08.349
like equal


00:26:09.352 --> 00:26:11.483
A toxic notion my boy


00:26:11.490 --> 00:26:15.397
History has shown that we are superior species


00:26:15.398 --> 00:26:19.465
What if word of your misguided ideas where to spread


00:26:19.840 --> 00:26:27.680
It would be the undoing of the
civilisation as we know it


00:26:32.334 --> 00:26:34.430
Did we get him?


00:26:36.476 --> 00:26:38.276
Now!


00:26:39.780 --> 00:26:41.514
Sorry to barge in


00:26:41.553 --> 00:26:46.518
You think you can come into my home, sit in my father's chair,


00:26:46.529 --> 00:26:48.501
and threaten my dragon


00:26:48.534 --> 00:26:50.000
This is Berk


00:26:50.470 --> 00:26:52.539
And we've defended our way of life


00:26:52.577 --> 00:26:54.370
from far worst than you


00:26:56.317 --> 00:26:59.519
A Fighting spirit I love it. Only


00:26:59.525 --> 00:27:01.650
I'm afraid you're mistaken


00:27:01.700 --> 00:27:05.497
You've never seen anything like me


00:27:14.522 --> 00:27:16.390
Astrid, look out!


00:27:23.000 --> 00:27:24.000
Look out!


00:27:24.000 --> 00:27:25.000
Son Get Clear


00:27:37.570 --> 00:27:40.545
Have my dragon ready when I return


00:27:40.578 --> 00:27:44.449
Or I will destroy everything you love


00:28:01.487 --> 00:28:04.392
Alright everybody, settle down pls!


00:28:05.562 --> 00:28:10.370
Fishlegs, have you ever seen
that species of dragon before


00:28:12.543 --> 00:28:13.638
Let me had him!


00:28:13.646 --> 00:28:15.479
I give it a piece of my mind


00:28:15.516 --> 00:28:17.511
And my mind I mean fist


00:28:18.000 --> 00:28:20.500
Did you miss the part where we almost died


00:28:20.800 --> 00:28:23.457
Have you seen my house


00:28:23.499 --> 00:28:28.375
This is a new kind of enemy and I underestimated him
Now that's on me


00:28:28.410 --> 00:28:31.439
but I will not do that again


00:28:31.449 --> 00:28:33.480
We're vikings, we don't run from a fight


00:28:33.480 --> 00:28:36.000
At least, I don't. You might


00:28:36.000 --> 00:28:37.560
I agree with Hiccup


00:28:37.590 --> 00:28:39.662
We haven't seen the last of Grimmel


00:28:39.667 --> 00:28:42.650
He is a predator. A single minded and patient


00:28:42.650 --> 00:28:44.700
He won't stop until he gets what he wants


00:28:44.700 --> 00:28:46.540
I agree with Eret


00:28:46.548 --> 00:28:48.500
We have to take this threat seriously


00:28:48.500 --> 00:28:50.700
Grimmel is just a sign of the times


00:28:50.700 --> 00:28:54.000
Our enemies are getting smarter, more determined


00:28:54.000 --> 00:28:58.632
We are not just overcrowded, we are exposed and vulnerable


00:28:58.675 --> 00:29:01.669
Short of full blown war and risking everyone we love


00:29:01.679 --> 00:29:04.586
I don't


00:29:05.587 --> 00:29:09.200
I don't see a way of staying here for any longer


00:29:09.200 --> 00:29:10.500
This is bull...


00:29:10.800 --> 00:29:11.460
Hey!


00:29:11.800 --> 00:29:13.597
Hear him out!


00:29:19.300 --> 00:29:23.492
If we want to live in peace with our dragon,


00:29:23.492 --> 00:29:27.300
- we need a better plan
- So what are you saying chief


00:29:27.300 --> 00:29:31.575
I'm saying we have to disappear
Off the map


00:29:31.576 --> 00:29:34.674
Take the dragons to a place where no one will find them


00:29:34.674 --> 00:29:36.750
And where might that be?


00:29:36.750 --> 00:29:39.350
He's talking about the quest for the hidden world


00:29:39.370 --> 00:29:40.457
A hidden what?


00:29:40.495 --> 00:29:42.625
Out to lunch!


00:29:42.632 --> 00:29:45.629
My father was obsessed with it when I was a boy


00:29:45.672 --> 00:29:49.000
He made notes and maps in search
of the ancestral homes


00:29:49.000 --> 00:29:50.990
of all dragons


00:29:50.990 --> 00:29:53.717
Tucked away somewhere beyond the edge of the world


00:29:53.720 --> 00:29:57.629
It may be the solution we need


00:29:57.630 --> 00:30:01.594
We are dragon people. It's where we belong


00:30:01.704 --> 00:30:04.610
Look! I know this is our home


00:30:05.648 --> 00:30:08.619
My father left me to protect it


00:30:08.619 --> 00:30:11.500
But Berk is more than this place


00:30:11.500 --> 00:30:15.100
We are Berk, the people, the dragons


00:30:15.100 --> 00:30:18.663
I say Berk is wherever we go


00:30:21.000 --> 00:30:24.485
I am with him! Who else?


00:30:43.020 --> 00:30:46.794
Excuse me! Coming through, just getting my food here


00:30:46.832 --> 00:30:49.807
Wish me luck eat your rocks. Eat your rocks!


00:30:50.400 --> 00:30:53.706
Gods, people who fly with the babies were the worst


00:30:55.150 --> 00:30:58.280
I feel like I'm always asking you this question, but


00:30:58.280 --> 00:31:00.120
<i>We've got to meet up


00:31:00.120 --> 00:31:02.320
Is this an actual plan or


00:31:02.320 --> 00:31:05.300
Just keep flying until we reach the end of the world


00:31:05.300 --> 00:31:07.310
Da, seems sensible


00:31:08.880 --> 00:31:12.340
- So, where are they?
- Gone obviously


00:31:12.340 --> 00:31:15.380
The Night Fury escaped you? Again?


00:31:15.380 --> 00:31:17.290
I encouraged it


00:31:17.290 --> 00:31:20.270
They've abandoned their only defensible position


00:31:20.270 --> 00:31:24.200
Running scared with what little they can carry


00:31:24.200 --> 00:31:28.310
- Just keeps going
- That's cause the world is actually round


00:31:28.310 --> 00:31:32.190
Sun is round, moon is round, stars are round


00:31:32.190 --> 00:31:36.360
- Even though they're small and stupid
- Right stars


00:31:36.360 --> 00:31:39.270
Don't fret, they won't get far


00:31:39.270 --> 00:31:42.180
The Night Fury is distracting them


00:31:42.500 --> 00:31:45.340
I introduced him to your female


00:31:45.500 --> 00:31:48.420
Furies mate for life you see


00:31:48.420 --> 00:31:50.000
What you picking up on bud?


00:31:52.910 --> 00:31:56.210
- The Light Fury
- She's following us


00:32:04.000 --> 00:32:06.320
Hold on Toothless!


00:32:13.000 --> 00:32:15.000
Well look who it is!?


00:32:17.860 --> 00:32:20.480
Hey! Its really nice to finally me...


00:32:34.000 --> 00:32:35.500
Not a word


00:32:38.500 --> 00:32:41.400
Yeah yeah, yes, but where did they go?


00:32:41.400 --> 00:32:43.430
Explains


00:32:43.430 --> 00:32:47.280
Night Furies can't survive in the cold so they haven't gone North


00:32:47.280 --> 00:32:49.380
They trying to put distance between themselves


00:32:49.380 --> 00:32:51.520
and enemies to the east and south


00:32:52.020 --> 00:32:56.360
And Night Furies cannot fly long distances without rest


00:32:57.360 --> 00:33:00.400
Their flights paths must include stops


00:33:00.400 --> 00:33:01.540
Party break!


00:33:03.840 --> 00:33:07.420
Therefore, they've gone...


00:33:08.000 --> 00:33:11.350
They can only have gone..


00:33:12.700 --> 00:33:15.330
Does anyone want to take a guess?


00:33:16.330 --> 00:33:17.500
Anyone?


00:33:20.100 --> 00:33:21.540
East!


00:33:22.300 --> 00:33:24.420
West!


00:33:24.420 --> 00:33:26.400
Simple, you see


00:33:26.400 --> 00:33:29.440
Isn't this fun.
Yes!


00:33:29.440 --> 00:33:30.600
No


00:33:30.600 --> 00:33:35.370
Yes Yes


00:33:35.370 --> 00:33:37.410
Where is your love of the hunt


00:33:37.410 --> 00:33:39.410
I thought you were conquerors


00:33:39.410 --> 00:33:41.800
You'll have your prize in time


00:33:41.800 --> 00:33:45.500
Just allow me a few more days to enjoy this


00:33:46.330 --> 00:33:49.480
I have dearly missed it


00:33:49.480 --> 00:33:52.470
All right, it looks like we're camping here tonight


00:33:52.470 --> 00:33:56.520
- Well, thank Thor for that!
- Yes my own place


00:33:56.520 --> 00:33:59.560
I planned to build a hut only for the bearded


00:33:59.560 --> 00:34:01.570
Ruffnut, you gonna stay out


00:34:01.570 --> 00:34:03.500
Chin whiskers don't count


00:34:03.500 --> 00:34:06.570
I saw the tower of manliness in the shape of me


00:34:06.570 --> 00:34:10.450
Its gonna be taller than Eret with bigger muscles


00:34:10.450 --> 00:34:13.360
- What?
- Get out of my house!


00:34:13.360 --> 00:34:15.630
- Is there problem here
- Yeah! There's a problem


00:34:15.630 --> 00:34:18.500
Ever since you showed up, you been trying to upstage me


00:34:18.500 --> 00:34:20.600
You're just so jealous, its delusional


00:34:20.600 --> 00:34:22.610
Yeah, delusion is a good word for it


00:34:22.610 --> 00:34:23.640
Listen, son of Eret


00:34:23.640 --> 00:34:26.520
When Hiccup blows as a chief, I'm next in line


00:34:26.520 --> 00:34:29.260
Number two because
I'm clearly Valka's favourite


00:34:29.260 --> 00:34:32.000
So you better start showing me some respect


00:34:33.300 --> 00:34:35.640
- Strange little man
- Don't mind him


00:34:35.640 --> 00:34:39.610
It is not your fault that you
have the body of a northern god


00:34:39.610 --> 00:34:42.380
I myself have the same problem
Yeah!


00:34:44.000 --> 00:34:47.620
Blacksmith stall goes right here


00:34:47.620 --> 00:34:52.510
1, 2, 3, 4, 5 What?


00:34:52.510 --> 00:34:56.480
Okay, hold on gang, I said, make camp


00:34:56.480 --> 00:34:59.420
- Did you see them?
- Not build a new village


00:34:59.420 --> 00:35:01.550
Who died and makes you chief


00:35:01.550 --> 00:35:02.650
What?


00:35:03.400 --> 00:35:06.440
Granted, This place is very nice,


00:35:06.440 --> 00:35:08.470
but this it's not the hidden world


00:35:08.470 --> 00:35:11.570
We don't even know if...
this hidden world even exists


00:35:11.570 --> 00:35:13.610
Yes, this place is real


00:35:13.610 --> 00:35:18.660
There is nothing more stubborn
than a mob of tired, hungry Vikings


00:35:18.660 --> 00:35:22.630
Huh! Well, I guess this could work
as a base in the meantime


00:35:22.630 --> 00:35:25.480
Its defensible, hidden


00:35:26.260 --> 00:35:28.300
Alright! You could stay


00:35:28.490 --> 00:35:30.510
Say Hello to the new Berk


00:35:30.510 --> 00:35:31.720
Let's get building lads


00:35:31.720 --> 00:35:34.530
Until Toothless and I found the Hidden World


00:35:37.450 --> 00:35:41.700
Now about that voice
Can we loose the whole honking goose thing


00:35:41.700 --> 00:35:45.660
Tired to imagine wedded bliss
with that going up every minute. Eheheh!


00:35:46.860 --> 00:35:49.620
If you're going to continue west, I should head back


00:35:49.620 --> 00:35:51.430
to make sure we weren't followed


00:35:51.430 --> 00:35:54.500
- Great idea I'll go with you for protection
- No!


00:35:54.500 --> 00:35:58.640
- You're far too important here
- Yeah


00:35:59.000 --> 00:36:01.650
Just be careful


00:36:01.650 --> 00:36:04.560
What?


00:36:04.560 --> 00:36:08.560
The plan to hide us from the rest of the world


00:36:08.560 --> 00:36:11.600
Though I wish it were possible,


00:36:11.600 --> 00:36:13.580
I fear it can't last, Hiccup


00:36:13.580 --> 00:36:16.480
Well, You know I've tried to do the same for years


00:36:16.480 --> 00:36:21.690
But greedy humans always find a way


00:36:21.690 --> 00:36:26.500
I just, I only ask that you think about it


00:36:29.120 --> 00:36:31.300
Do you still think I'm crazy, or...


00:36:31.300 --> 00:36:35.750
Let's just say, this whole idea is very you


00:36:35.750 --> 00:36:39.660
Well, Thank you for supporting me last night.
That meant a lot


00:36:39.660 --> 00:36:42.540
Don't thank me yet


00:36:42.540 --> 00:36:44.770
I just hope you're right about this


00:37:04.390 --> 00:37:07.390
Toothless, no its too early


00:42:37.000 --> 00:42:38.940
Now you can draw


00:44:00.300 --> 00:44:02.120
Someone has not slept


00:44:02.120 --> 00:44:05.120
Yeah! Well that Light Fury wont
let me within a mile of her


00:44:05.120 --> 00:44:07.000
and neither of us will be getting any sleep


00:44:07.000 --> 00:44:10.070
or find the Hidden World
until Toothless takes over


00:44:10.070 --> 00:44:11.100
Hey!


00:44:11.100 --> 00:44:13.080
What do you think of that?


00:44:13.080 --> 00:44:18.050
- Yeah!
- You've tried that once before. He didn't want it


00:44:18.050 --> 00:44:21.190
Well, until now he didn't have a reason to


00:44:21.190 --> 00:44:23.070
Right bud?


00:44:30.530 --> 00:44:35.030
- What?
- No nothing. I'm... I'm impressed


00:44:35.030 --> 00:44:39.260
I mean look at you embracing change, I'm proud of you


00:44:39.260 --> 00:44:43.180
Well, he is my best bud. I want him to be happy


00:44:43.180 --> 00:44:47.150
and besides, it's just until he brings her back


00:44:51.000 --> 00:44:54.200
Alright! Fire when ready


00:45:00.600 --> 00:45:04.060
Well, I guess you know the tail is fire proof


00:45:04.060 --> 00:45:08.250
Okay, Toothless


00:45:08.250 --> 00:45:13.800
Yes I know, Shh! Okay, I know
Please this is not helping


00:45:13.800 --> 00:45:16.300
Well, well, well, someones is excited


00:45:16.300 --> 00:45:19.140
Fresh of his first date


00:45:19.140 --> 00:45:21.160
He's in love crazy


00:45:21.160 --> 00:45:23.090
Only we are the ones who going crazy


00:45:23.090 --> 00:45:25.330
The sooner he brings back that Light Fury, the better


00:45:25.330 --> 00:45:28.300
Yeah but to do that, he'll need to fly without me


00:45:28.300 --> 00:45:31.280
So time to give this new and improved baby a shot


00:45:33.280 --> 00:45:36.310
Atta boy! Lookin' sharp Toothless!


00:45:36.310 --> 00:45:39.130
So What do you think bud?


00:45:39.130 --> 00:45:43.290
Bring her home. By sundown at the latest


00:45:43.290 --> 00:45:48.300
No, Save it for your girlfriend
Go on, get out of here


00:45:56.500 --> 00:45:57.000
Its okay


00:46:55.500 --> 00:46:57.290
Watch out!


00:47:00.500 --> 00:47:02.370
Go, Cloudjumper!


00:50:14.500 --> 00:50:19.000
To the chief


00:50:22.520 --> 00:50:26.650
Okay, guys now I'm just getting sick


00:50:26.650 --> 00:50:32.670
You'll see, I thought you were well off your record
but this spot ain't half bad


00:50:32.670 --> 00:50:35.540
This suppose to be a temporary solution


00:50:35.540 --> 00:50:40.620
Its unanimous, everyone agrees we've definitely traded it up
Well done Chief


00:50:40.620 --> 00:50:43.630
What if the tail is broken


00:50:43.630 --> 00:50:44.690
What if Grimmel found him


00:50:44.690 --> 00:50:47.640
- What if he needs me?
- Would you relax?


00:50:47.640 --> 00:50:50.510
He's probably having the time of his life


00:50:50.510 --> 00:50:52.540
How would I know? She never comes around


00:50:52.540 --> 00:50:55.420
And when she does, she always rushing off


00:50:55.420 --> 00:50:58.590
I'm saying, how would we know if she's right for us?


00:50:58.590 --> 00:51:00.620
- Us?
- You know what I mean


00:51:00.620 --> 00:51:03.570
She's so wild and skittish
I'm just gonna say it


00:51:03.570 --> 00:51:05.540
I don't trust her


00:51:05.540 --> 00:51:10.540
God team of all, Hiccup.
One day you'll have to snip those apron strings


00:51:10.540 --> 00:51:12.530
and let Toothless stretch his wings


00:51:12.530 --> 00:51:15.730
Reminds me of a talk I had
with Stoic about you


00:51:15.730 --> 00:51:19.530
Where did they keep coming from?


00:51:19.530 --> 00:51:22.480
- Who?
- Those bloody Hobgobblers


00:51:22.480 --> 00:51:24.710
I swear they're popping up faster than rabbits


00:51:24.710 --> 00:51:26.690
I think they want to eat me


00:51:26.690 --> 00:51:29.530
Evidence would suggests I'm tasty


00:51:29.530 --> 00:51:30.620
Hicky, a moment


00:51:30.620 --> 00:51:33.500
Listen, I've been watching you walk


00:51:33.500 --> 00:51:35.700
Loose the limp. No ones gonna marry that


00:51:35.700 --> 00:51:38.610
- I have a prosthetic leg
- So am I


00:51:38.610 --> 00:51:41.680
Yeah, you are parasitic twin
but you'll not see me limping around about it


00:51:41.680 --> 00:51:45.590
Come on! Chin up Hicky, Puff out that chest


00:51:45.590 --> 00:51:47.760
Move that butt to the left


00:51:55.760 --> 00:51:58.690
Mom, are you hurt? What happened out there?


00:51:58.690 --> 00:52:01.630
I don't know how, but Grimmel is tracking us


00:52:01.630 --> 00:52:04.660
This is all because of the Hobgobblers


00:52:04.660 --> 00:52:07.000
He has hundreds ships, maybe more


00:52:07.000 --> 00:52:10.510
With enough cages for all our dragons


00:52:10.510 --> 00:52:15.520
If Grimmel is leading them here,
we have to take him out of the mix


00:52:15.520 --> 00:52:17.750
And how would we do that?


00:52:17.750 --> 00:52:21.630
- By going there and capture him
- Capture him?


00:52:21.630 --> 00:52:23.760
I am with him! Who else?


00:53:10.000 --> 00:53:13.680
Okay, split up! We will be harder to catch


00:53:13.680 --> 00:53:16.780
I was thinking we just split up, just because


00:53:16.780 --> 00:53:18.720
I like instincts


00:53:18.720 --> 00:53:20.850
What is this?


00:54:01.000 --> 00:54:02.870
Quiet!


00:54:02.870 --> 00:54:05.850
Where's your dragon when you needed?


00:54:05.850 --> 00:54:07.810
Chief?


00:54:07.810 --> 00:54:09.880
Must have forgotten all about you?


00:54:11.010 --> 00:54:12.890
The first rule of the hunt


00:54:12.890 --> 00:54:15.700
Separate the pray from its pack


00:54:15.700 --> 00:54:19.000
You just removed yourselves from the equation


00:54:19.000 --> 00:54:23.780
- Why are you doing this?
- Really? I do not think you care


00:54:23.780 --> 00:54:28.740
Well, unlike you, when I was a boy
and I came up on a Night Fury


00:54:28.740 --> 00:54:30.830
I killed him where he slept


00:54:30.830 --> 00:54:35.680
That simple act of courage
made me a hero in my village


00:54:35.680 --> 00:54:38.820
So I decided to kill every last one


00:54:38.820 --> 00:54:42.690
Bringing real peace to the people of this world


00:54:42.690 --> 00:54:49.840
Until you came along, preaching that dragons
are something other than thieves and murderers


00:54:49.850 --> 00:54:53.000
That nonsense dies now


00:54:53.000 --> 00:54:54.920
Starting with you


00:54:54.920 --> 00:54:56.760
But you have a dragons of your own


00:54:56.760 --> 00:55:00.870
These!?
They are dragon killers


00:55:00.870 --> 00:55:03.970
Drugged into obedience with their own venom


00:55:03.970 --> 00:55:07.970
Not even your precious Alpha could control them


00:55:07.970 --> 00:55:10.960
They serve me, and only me


00:55:10.960 --> 00:55:12.930
Allow me to demonstrate


00:55:13.230 --> 00:55:14.950
Take cover!


00:55:19.000 --> 00:55:20.840
Spread out!


00:56:05.800 --> 00:56:07.000
Hurry!


00:56:09.000 --> 00:56:10.870
Go go go!


00:56:10.870 --> 00:56:14.890
Hiccup!


00:56:20.000 --> 00:56:21.500
Got ya!


00:56:21.500 --> 00:56:22.930
Let's go, Cloudjumper!


00:56:45.000 --> 00:56:48.050
He takes that stupid baby everywhere


00:56:54.000 --> 00:56:57.000
- God almighty!
- Guess we won't be needing this thing huh?


00:56:57.000 --> 00:57:00.980
- I let us right into his trap
- Yeah nice work, Chief!


00:57:00.980 --> 00:57:02.960
Right, Ruff


00:57:02.960 --> 00:57:07.130
- Wait... where is Ruffnut?
- We left her behind?


00:57:07.130 --> 00:57:09.830
How could you not notice she was missing?


00:57:09.830 --> 00:57:11.000
You ride a two-headed dragon


00:57:11.000 --> 00:57:14.950
Yeah, I feel like Ruffnut is every day


00:57:14.950 --> 00:57:17.850
- Dumb
- Odin be spanked


00:57:17.850 --> 00:57:20.020
This just gets better and better


00:57:20.020 --> 00:57:24.810
I've tried to avoided looking
right at her gives me ass of reflex


00:57:24.910 --> 00:57:27.880
Ok ok guys just keep your helmets on
Toothless and I will...


00:57:27.880 --> 00:57:31.910
Toothless has the Light Fury now,
he's probably not even coming back


00:57:31.910 --> 00:57:36.050
- What?
- You gave him his freedom, Hiccup. What were you expecting?


00:57:36.050 --> 00:57:38.120
I never thought he would stay away for good


00:57:38.120 --> 00:57:39.900
I've... I've..


00:57:39.900 --> 00:57:44.000
Look I'll figure it out.
I just need more time


00:57:46.000 --> 00:57:48.910
He thinks he has to lead alone


00:57:48.910 --> 00:57:51.920
Well, Because his father had to


00:57:51.920 --> 00:57:55.160
He doesn't realise the strength he have together


00:57:55.160 --> 00:57:59.940
- Do you still believe in him
- Of course!


00:57:59.940 --> 00:58:00.910
I wished he did


00:58:00.910 --> 00:58:04.910
But he thinks he's nothing without Toothless


00:58:04.910 --> 00:58:08.930
Then help him realise the truth


00:58:13.000 --> 00:58:14.160
- Get on!
- What?


00:58:14.160 --> 00:58:17.180
- We are going to find him
- Really!?


00:58:19.000 --> 00:58:21.090
Everybody stay put


00:58:21.090 --> 00:58:25.120
- We will get Ruffnut back. Don't worry
- Worry?!


00:58:25.120 --> 00:58:27.070
If they are stuffed with Ruffnut,


00:58:27.070 --> 00:58:29.070
I am more worried about them


00:58:31.000 --> 00:58:33.050
Why the long face?


00:58:33.050 --> 00:58:35.940
I mean mines long, but yours is really long


00:58:35.940 --> 00:58:38.190
All face with no brain, like you got stretched in birth


00:58:38.190 --> 00:58:39.960
Do you have a twin too?


00:58:39.960 --> 00:58:42.120
Tuffnut took up all the rooms in moms belly


00:58:42.120 --> 00:58:43.100
Otherwise I will have a rounder head


00:58:43.100 --> 00:58:45.160
and more brains, that's science


00:58:45.160 --> 00:58:48.130
My braids are like little zipper bags, see


00:58:48.130 --> 00:58:54.960
Yeah! Even the mould spots looks like eyes, so cute
they even have little horns and everything


00:58:54.960 --> 00:58:56.950
Just Like Barf and Belch except me and Barf can't stand Belch


00:58:56.950 --> 00:58:58.970
So there really just Barfs


00:58:58.970 --> 00:59:00.090
Its warm in here


00:59:00.090 --> 00:59:02.040
I know what you've thinking


00:59:02.040 --> 00:59:04.170
You have never had a prisoner this hot


00:59:04.170 --> 00:59:07.110
All the boys love me, except Eret


00:59:07.110 --> 00:59:08.210
Who totally lost his chance


00:59:08.210 --> 00:59:11.020
That should pass sail boys, Sorry!


00:59:11.020 --> 00:59:14.050
And Hiccup is practically married
to that round head Astrid


00:59:14.050 --> 00:59:17.060
But it's not loud and officially
so they are basically my inherent


00:59:17.060 --> 00:59:19.130
A just getting choosed you know


00:59:19.130 --> 00:59:21.240
Its not a lot of beef cake,
but almost too good you know


00:59:21.240 --> 00:59:24.150
Sometimes I think he's more
in love with himself than me


00:59:24.150 --> 00:59:26.210
There is only room for one beauty
in this relationship


00:59:26.210 --> 00:59:29.130
Fishlegs will keep me alive longer


00:59:29.130 --> 00:59:30.190
if I had to eat one of them


00:59:30.190 --> 00:59:32.100
straight from the glacier somewhere but


00:59:32.100 --> 00:59:33.160
He never shuts up about dragons


00:59:33.160 --> 00:59:35.200
Don't you hate when people never stop talking


00:59:35.200 --> 00:59:38.150
Yes I do
Blah, blah, bla Very boring


00:59:38.150 --> 00:59:39.120
Its so boring


00:59:39.120 --> 00:59:41.150
Can we just feed her to your dragons


00:59:41.150 --> 00:59:44.130
If you have to eat around here,
I'm allergic to fish you should know that


00:59:44.130 --> 00:59:47.000
That's all they have on that stupid new island


00:59:47.000 --> 00:59:49.070
Too many clams


00:59:49.070 --> 00:59:50.270
They are like little mouths with slimy food inside


00:59:50.270 --> 00:59:52.280
that's already chewed, like the way mommy used to do it


00:59:52.280 --> 00:59:54.140
Enough!


00:59:54.140 --> 00:59:58.220
Until I turned 12 years old
and she's like "Chew your own food"


00:59:58.220 --> 01:00:00.130
And I said, "No, I do not like it"


01:00:00.130 --> 01:00:03.100
Most annoying creature ever to cross my path


01:00:03.100 --> 01:00:08.080
Can you let the dragon come out


01:00:11.050 --> 01:00:16.130
Take him and go! Please, I beg you!


01:00:16.130 --> 01:00:19.230
The Deathgripper will have to forget dinner


01:00:19.230 --> 01:00:22.210
You feed your dragons, dragons?!


01:00:22.210 --> 01:00:25.210
- Go!
- Where is your bathroom? I gotta...


01:00:25.210 --> 01:00:29.150
Okay, Gods, no wonder you have grey hair


01:00:29.150 --> 01:00:33.130
Stress is not good for you


01:00:33.130 --> 01:00:37.070
So long losers!


01:00:37.070 --> 01:00:49.200
Where, where is she heading?
She is tracking something


01:00:49.200 --> 01:00:50.360
Aren't you girl?


01:00:50.360 --> 01:00:54.300
There is nothing but miles and miles of...


01:01:25.000 --> 01:01:29.180
- A wide waterfall
- At the end of the world


01:01:31.520 --> 01:01:33.280
Stormfly!


01:03:49.000 --> 01:03:51.540
It really does exists!


01:04:09.000 --> 01:04:12.350
- Toothless!
- You'll spook them.


01:04:55.000 --> 01:04:57.380
Now That's the King


01:05:38.000 --> 01:05:41.440
We should go


01:05:41.440 --> 01:05:43.570
Oh no


01:05:52.000 --> 01:05:55.500
Firefly!


01:06:12.000 --> 01:06:14.570
Down! Go!


01:06:26.000 --> 01:06:28.570
I'm sorry, but but, I can exp...


01:06:51.900 --> 01:06:54.630
Son!


01:06:54.630 --> 01:06:59.730
- You should be asleep
- I was thirsty


01:07:03.000 --> 01:07:05.550
Yeah! Come here


01:07:17.000 --> 01:07:18.580
Dad!?


01:07:18.580 --> 01:07:21.780
Are you gonna get us a new mom?


01:07:24.500 --> 01:07:28.500
I don't want another. Your mom!


01:07:28.500 --> 01:07:30.560
Was the only woman for me


01:07:30.560 --> 01:07:33.610
And she was all love of my life


01:07:35.500 --> 01:07:39.620
But with love comes loss, son


01:07:39.620 --> 01:07:41.620
That's part of the deal


01:07:41.620 --> 01:07:44.790
Sometimes it hurts, but in the end


01:07:44.790 --> 01:07:47.640
its all worth it


01:07:49.000 --> 01:07:52.740
There is no better gift than love


01:08:34.500 --> 01:08:40.640
It's okay, bud!
You belong there, with her


01:08:40.640 --> 01:08:42.850
We don't


01:08:45.850 --> 01:08:47.820
And that's alright


01:08:47.820 --> 01:08:51.810
We'll find a way to man


01:09:00.500 --> 01:09:02.000
Hey!


01:09:03.000 --> 01:09:05.730
She followed us back


01:09:10.400 --> 01:09:12.880
We might not have to say goodbye after all


01:09:20.000 --> 01:09:22.700
That's it!


01:09:22.700 --> 01:09:25.900
- Ruffnut
- Miss me


01:09:25.900 --> 01:09:27.200
How did you escape?


01:09:27.200 --> 01:09:29.680
I annoyed them until they let me go


01:09:29.680 --> 01:09:33.790
Wait! Grimmel let you go?!


01:09:33.790 --> 01:09:35.760
So dumb. They couldn't handle me


01:09:35.760 --> 01:09:37.860
See everyone thinks Tuffnut is more annoying, but


01:09:37.860 --> 01:09:41.900
- Hold on
- Ruffnut, focus. Were you followed?


01:09:41.900 --> 01:09:44.680
I never looked back, Hiccup


01:09:45.680 --> 01:09:49.720
Toothless!


01:10:00.000 --> 01:10:01.880
Toothless, come back!


01:10:10.000 --> 01:10:11.740
No!


01:10:28.000 --> 01:10:32.780
Now, our little game must come to an end


01:10:37.000 --> 01:10:38.860
Call them off Alpha


01:10:38.860 --> 01:10:42.000
No reason for her to die to


01:10:55.000 --> 01:10:56.830
What are you doing?


01:10:56.830 --> 01:10:57.960
They can totally take him!


01:10:57.960 --> 01:11:00.030
Not with her life on the line


01:11:03.000 --> 01:11:04.850
Save your breath


01:11:04.850 --> 01:11:08.020
The only Alpha they respond to is me


01:11:13.000 --> 01:11:18.000
Don't feel too badly.
You've tried your best


01:11:18.000 --> 01:11:22.950
But you're nothing without your dragon


01:11:38.300 --> 01:11:39.890
Toothless!


01:11:57.000 --> 01:12:00.900
Now that is just... Great!
Now What?


01:12:00.900 --> 01:12:04.070
I think it's time for
number 2 to become number 1


01:12:04.070 --> 01:12:06.070
He'll listen to you


01:12:10.000 --> 01:12:13.020
- Don't say it
- I wasn't going to


01:12:13.020 --> 01:12:15.090
I should have dragged you out there


01:12:15.090 --> 01:12:17.970
He wouldn't have flown me back.
She wouldn't have followed


01:12:17.970 --> 01:12:19.840
Yeap


01:12:19.840 --> 01:12:21.970
I feel like the same screwed-up
I was before I met Toothless


01:12:21.970 --> 01:12:24.010
I can see that


01:12:24.010 --> 01:12:26.890
Are you just gonna stand there
and agree with everything?!


01:12:26.890 --> 01:12:29.920
Well, You're right,
you're back to where you started


01:12:29.920 --> 01:12:32.870
But I was the first to believe in you


01:12:32.870 --> 01:12:36.100
And I have watched you doubt
whether you're worthy ever since


01:12:36.100 --> 01:12:38.080
But you know what


01:12:38.080 --> 01:12:42.110
I am the person I am today because of you


01:12:42.110 --> 01:12:45.090
I never told you that, but it's true


01:12:45.090 --> 01:12:49.000
You are the bravest, most stubborn,
most determined


01:12:49.000 --> 01:12:52.000
knuckle-head I know


01:12:52.000 --> 01:12:54.910
Toothless didn't give you that, Hiccup!


01:12:54.910 --> 01:12:57.890
- He just made it
- Easier


01:12:57.890 --> 01:13:00.120
And now it gonna be a lot harder


01:13:00.120 --> 01:13:05.000
So, what are you gonna do about it?


01:13:05.000 --> 01:13:07.940
Probably something stupid


01:13:07.940 --> 01:13:10.150
That's the Hiccup I know


01:13:12.600 --> 01:13:16.050
Suit up gang! We're going to get them back!


01:13:16.050 --> 01:13:18.700
What?
He's lost his mind


01:13:18.700 --> 01:13:22.130
Now that's marriage material


01:13:22.130 --> 01:13:25.980
At last, faithful people, you're ready


01:13:25.980 --> 01:13:29.150
How are we gonna get our dragons back?


01:13:29.150 --> 01:13:32.020
- Without dragons
- Trust me


01:13:39.500 --> 01:13:42.010
Move!


01:13:42.950 --> 01:13:46.180
That's right, Alpha


01:13:46.180 --> 01:13:48.920
No surprises


01:13:58.000 --> 01:14:02.110
Jump off the cliff in these


01:14:02.110 --> 01:14:05.030
- That's the best you've got
- No


01:14:05.030 --> 01:14:07.000
You guys are the best I've got


01:14:07.000 --> 01:14:10.930
I'm with him! Who else?


01:14:10.930 --> 01:14:15.070
Thats was my line.
Let's go!


01:14:15.070 --> 01:14:20.090
Yes!


01:14:33.000 --> 01:14:39.030
You didn't think I would actually
hand you the Night Fury did you?


01:14:39.030 --> 01:14:40.260
He's mine to kill


01:14:40.260 --> 01:14:42.070
That Snake


01:14:42.070 --> 01:14:45.100
I intend to finish what I've started


01:14:45.100 --> 01:14:49.000
Best of luck controlling them without an Alpha


01:14:49.000 --> 01:14:50.000
Hold on Toothless!


01:14:55.000 --> 01:15:01.000
Could have used some perculations to skip breakfast


01:15:11.800 --> 01:15:14.070
Toothless!


01:15:33.500 --> 01:15:35.280
Perfect timing!


01:15:37.800 --> 01:15:40.090
Game Faces


01:15:40.090 --> 01:15:42.160
Good boy! Get in there!


01:16:25.000 --> 01:16:26.350
Heads up!


01:16:27.000 --> 01:16:29.250
Thanks, look out!


01:16:32.000 --> 01:16:33.260
Thanks!


01:16:59.000 --> 01:17:01.360
I'm coming Toothless!


01:17:01.900 --> 01:17:04.330
You still think he cares about you


01:17:07.000 --> 01:17:10.370
Let's just see who he follows


01:17:22.000 --> 01:17:24.400
I'm sorry bud, for everything


01:17:43.000 --> 01:17:45.290
Let's go get her


01:17:48.900 --> 01:17:52.000
Yeah! Number 2 Coming through


01:17:52.000 --> 01:17:53.230
Surprise!


01:17:53.430 --> 01:17:55.440
Sorry about that


01:17:55.440 --> 01:17:57.000
Come On!


01:17:59.500 --> 01:18:01.500
One more free, 4 to go


01:18:04.360 --> 01:18:06.370
Try To keep up!


01:18:06.370 --> 01:18:08.430
I'll got your backs


01:18:10.430 --> 01:18:13.380
Yeah! Its almost like we're a team


01:18:15.680 --> 01:18:19.520
You brought a baby to a battle


01:18:19.520 --> 01:18:22.430
I wouldn't do that if I were you


01:18:33.000 --> 01:18:35.330
God! I love that dragon


01:18:40.000 --> 01:18:44.310
- Sorry we're late for the party
- You're right on time


01:18:53.310 --> 01:18:55.420
That's it! That's it!


01:19:06.000 --> 01:19:08.260
How do we get him off her back without hearting her?


01:19:09.390 --> 01:19:12.300
Fear the facial hair!


01:19:20.000 --> 01:19:23.330
- I have missed this
- Me too!


01:19:23.330 --> 01:19:27.520
- See that there
- Cute!


01:19:27.520 --> 01:19:30.540
That's a bad omen. You're cursed


01:19:36.000 --> 01:19:39.490
Yes! Go! Good on you!


01:19:39.490 --> 01:19:43.330
I Guess your not so bad after all


01:20:05.000 --> 01:20:07.540
Leave the ship!


01:20:26.540 --> 01:20:28.620
We got problems!


01:20:43.620 --> 01:20:45.630
Get him, Hiccup!


01:20:54.600 --> 01:20:56.610
We need a better plan


01:20:56.610 --> 01:20:58.490
and quick!


01:21:02.000 --> 01:21:04.500
Bat guy! What are you doing?


01:21:06.000 --> 01:21:07.640
Ok! Ok!


01:21:32.000 --> 01:21:35.640
You're killing both of us!


01:21:35.640 --> 01:21:39.510
Fighting over a dragon. That's your plan?!


01:21:41.500 --> 01:21:43.640
This is


01:21:47.500 --> 01:21:49.560
Save him


01:22:33.680 --> 01:22:37.560
See! I knew you've come around


01:23:13.000 --> 01:23:16.550
Hey, good morning bud


01:23:16.550 --> 01:23:20.000
Here you go


01:23:20.000 --> 01:23:24.000
All you full of surprises


01:23:24.000 --> 01:23:26.790
He's all yours


01:23:37.790 --> 01:23:41.000
You know Eret may be blessed with brawl but


01:23:41.000 --> 01:23:44.700
just between us, you have the brains


01:23:44.700 --> 01:23:46.710
No. 1


01:24:18.500 --> 01:24:21.720
You're right, bud. It's time


01:24:23.000 --> 01:24:27.850
I was so busy, fighting for a world that I wanted


01:24:27.850 --> 01:24:31.830
I didn't think about what you needed


01:24:34.500 --> 01:24:37.680
You've looked after us for long enough


01:24:37.680 --> 01:24:39.880
Time to look after yourselves


01:24:53.880 --> 01:24:57.000
Stormfly, my good girl


01:24:57.000 --> 01:24:58.790
All right Grumply


01:24:58.790 --> 01:25:01.000
Of you go


01:25:01.930 --> 01:25:05.940
So long, you bigerbly beast. I'll miss you


01:25:15.000 --> 01:25:16.860
Cloudjumper


01:25:26.000 --> 01:25:28.000
Go on, bud!


01:25:28.000 --> 01:25:30.920
Lead them to the hidden world


01:25:30.920 --> 01:25:33.930
You will be safe there


01:25:35.000 --> 01:25:37.910
Safer than you could ever be with me


01:25:37.910 --> 01:25:43.910
It's okay, I love you too and
I want you to be free


01:25:47.000 --> 01:25:49.800
Our world does not deserve you


01:25:49.800 --> 01:25:50.960
Yet


01:26:02.000 --> 01:26:03.990
Go Toothless


01:26:05.000 --> 01:26:07.030
Go


01:28:34.000 --> 01:28:36.950
For chief and the chieftess


01:28:36.950 --> 01:28:38.180
Yeah


01:28:40.000 --> 01:28:44.130
Come, cry to my full thick beard


01:28:44.130 --> 01:28:48.030
Give me a hug
Gross


01:28:48.030 --> 01:28:50.170
Okay, you win


01:28:50.170 --> 01:28:52.950
I like sensitive guys


01:29:26.000 --> 01:29:30.120
There were dragons when I was a boy


01:29:32.000 --> 01:29:36.200
There were great grim sky dragons
that nested at the cliff tops


01:29:36.200 --> 01:29:38.110
like gigantic scary birds


01:29:39.000 --> 01:29:44.050
little brown scadily dragons,
that hunted down the mice and rats


01:29:44.050 --> 01:29:46.060
and well organised packs


01:29:46.060 --> 01:29:52.200
Preposterously huge sea dragons that were
20 times as big as the big blue whale


01:29:52.200 --> 01:29:57.050
Some say they crawl back into the sea leaving


01:29:57.050 --> 01:30:00.180
not a bone not a fang from men to remember them by


01:30:00.180 --> 01:30:04.260
Other say they were nothing but folk tales to begin with


01:30:04.990 --> 01:30:09.070
I'm okay with that!


01:30:28.070 --> 01:30:32.150
Hey, hey there bud


01:30:38.800 --> 01:30:41.110
Remember me


01:30:43.000 --> 01:30:44.280
Its ok


01:30:55.500 --> 01:30:58.170
It's glad to see you too


01:30:58.170 --> 01:31:01.080
He's not gonna eat your father


01:31:02.000 --> 01:31:04.000
How is your tail holding up


01:31:04.000 --> 01:31:07.100
Do you want to see me do a little bit more fine tuning


01:31:07.100 --> 01:31:09.360
Its ok, they're friends


01:31:14.400 --> 01:31:19.280
Come here. Come on,
Go on, its alright


01:31:19.280 --> 01:31:21.350
He won't hurt you


01:31:21.350 --> 01:31:25.230
Hold your hands out, like this


01:31:25.230 --> 01:31:28.110
That's it


01:31:31.200 --> 01:31:33.350
Let him come to you


01:32:26.000 --> 01:32:29.360
The legend says, that when the ground quakes


01:32:29.360 --> 01:32:32.400
or lava spews from the earth, its the dragons


01:32:32.400 --> 01:32:35.240
Letting us know their still here


01:32:36.000 --> 01:32:39.290
Waiting for us to figure out how to get along


01:32:47.000 --> 01:32:48.370
Yes


01:32:48.370 --> 01:32:50.440
The world believes that the dragons are gone


01:32:50.440 --> 01:32:53.450
if they ever existed at all


01:32:53.450 --> 01:32:56.220
But we Berkin's we know otherwise


01:32:57.000 --> 01:33:01.370
And we'll guard the secret until the time comes


01:33:01.370 --> 01:33:06.180
when the dragon can return in peace
